  "description": "Kippo is a lightweight, attribute-based framework for building Telegram bots in C# and .NET (ASP.NET Core). Features attribute routing ([Command], [Text], [CallbackQuery]), session management, multi-step scenes and conversations, a middleware pipeline, fluent keyboard builders, webhooks, flood control, and first-class unit testing.",
